# Site updates

Before you add an article, edit a page, change Ask about me, or name a click, follow `docs/SITE-UPDATE-GUIDE.md`.

That guide wins over older notes when they disagree about the menu, the small page label, spacing, motion, mobile, URL slugs, articles, chat notes, or `data-track` names. Empty drafts (`DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`, `ANALYTICS-TAXONOMY.md`, `AI-SYSTEM.md`) do not override it.

Do not restate the guide inside a second doc. If a change needs a new rule, add it to the guide and remove the conflicting sentence.
